// IntroString :
"P1086369770" "Those Longbow scum can't get away with raiding our Arachnos base - that's the third one this week! I want to find the Longbow agent responsible for these raids and make an example of him!<br><br>Our Arachnos spies have their uses - they intercepted some transmissions and managed to find the Longbow base where their raid was staged from. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Take out everyone in that Longbow base and find who's heading up the anti-Arachnos operations!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4009594049" "Raid Longbow base"
// SendOffString :
"P851167709" "Take out everyone. I don't want anyone escaping!"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3660325663" "Defeat all Longbow in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P835786761" "Get to that Longbow base NOW! Find out who's been staging the anti-Arachnos ops!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1196445758" "No one messes with Arachnos, Captain Mako, or you!"

