// IntroString :
"P4129085297" "Savor this moment, {VillainName}. Look for the fear in your enemy's eyes as he realizes he cannot win this battle. Watch as he struggles to hang on for his pointless life. Revel in his destruction, and you will know true joy. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Show me you possess a true killer instinct by eliminating Ace McKnight!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1260976601" "Eliminate Ace McKnight"
// SendOffString :
"P2162051588" "I've got something for you to use in this battle. It's something my Arachnos boys have been working on: a Frenzy Mutagen which unlocks your more bestial instincts and turns you into a killing machine. Time to show your true colors, {VillainName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P451729252" "Defeat Ace McKnight"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2432856962" "This reminds me of the time I took out Scrapyard on those same docks - except I was quicker about it! Get movin'!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P666295043" "You wait in the truck until you see McKnight approach. Time to move in for the kill!"

